     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nissas-quest-2015-09-23#:~:text=As%20one%2C%20we%27ll%20reclaim%20Sea%20Gate.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nissas-quest-2015-09-23#:~:text=Three%20bodies%20were%20lined%20up%20against%20the%20wall."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "At Sea Gate he told Gideon the army could not win that day, and fought back to back with him when the retreat turned into a rout.",
    "cites": [
     "liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28-e3",
     "liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28-e4",
     "liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28-r1"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28#:~:text=%22We%27re%20not%20going%20to,Munda%20said.%20%22Not%20today.%22",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28#:~:text=The%20ordered%20retreat%20turned%20into%20a%20rout.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28#:~:text=The%20two%20of%20them,they%20fought%20well%20together."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Gideon then took Tazri and Munda to work out a plan that gave every contingent a role.",
    "cites": [
     "liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28-e7",
     "liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28-e8"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28#:~:text=%22Walk%20with%20me%2C%20Tazri%2C%22%20he%20said.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/liberation-sea-gate-2015-10-28#:~:text=Over%20the%20next%20few,a%20plan%20came%20together."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Later his troops, with Drana's, briefly turned the tide, and Tazri ordered him to prepare the troops to flee.",
